The clocks CMOS1_PCLK and clk_fpga_1 are related (timed together) but they have no common primary clock. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks CMOS1_PCLK] -to [get_clocks clk_fpga_1]
